raspi-utils-otp      20260626-1                   all    a11c106825fbdc5e664ebe30f6fff32c049931e976a8eb58edba8156fb88d0e8  BSD-3-Clause
raspinfo             20260626-1                   all    3d926e453d15779abe6df66164d71a205353d700d8a93a0c46dba752a96d2867  BSD-3-Clause
